menu "C5 UART capture"
    config C5_UART_RX_GPIO
        int "UART1 receive-only GPIO (verify board wiring before connecting)"
        range 0 28
        default 4
        help
            GPIO4 is an initial software default, NOT a verified UeeKKoo or
            Waveshare board connection. Verify the physical board before wiring.

    config C5_UART_BAUD
        int "UART receive baud rate"
        range 1200 2000000
        default 115200
endmenu
